# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# DB-044: resting on the clock says the whole long-form date.
wait 12
note nothing said while the pointer is elsewhere
expect-pixel 720 100 336698
move 930 100
wait 3
note the bubble carries the frozen fixture date, Friday, August 7, 2026
expect-pixel 720 100 ffffc8
move 500 400
wait 3
expect-pixel 720 100 336698
quit
